'''Tebul Sign Language''' ({{Langx|fr|Langue des signes de Tebul}}) is a [[village sign language]] of the village of [[Uluban]] in the [[Dogon people|Dogon]] region of [[Mali]], among speakers of [[Tebul Dogon]].

